<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Electro-Mechanics H1 net jumps.</title>
<headline>Samsung Electro-Mechanics H1 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 1,218  vs 778</p>
<p>    Net					 32.48  vs 19.34</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     35.44  vs 22.54</p>
<p>    Revenue				  806.15  vs 730.28</p>
<p>NOTE - Samsung Electro-Mechanics Co Ltd, a unit of the giant Samsung Group, is an integrated electronic parts maker with the largest production capacity in the country. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
